        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--pp-teal-50), var(--pp-white)); padding-top: var(--pp-space-12);\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container pp-container--narrow pp-text-center\" >\n        <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\" data-i18n=\"nav.ai\">AI Match</span>\n        <h1 data-i18n=\"ai.title\">AI Customization Wizard</h1>\n        <p class=\"pp-lead\" data-i18n=\"ai.subtitle\">Answer 4 questions. We'll match the top 5 SKUs from our 20-product library for your market.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
